      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "An ability to turn this off entirely for your world is needed then.\nThis would entirely break avatar PVP. \nBeing able to only shoot at something within close line-of-sight is gonna suck. \nAnd before you go on with 'hurrr avatar pvp isnt an officially supported feature durrrr just use worlds for it' remember that it has its place in the game. I personally love the ability to pit your creations against those of other players instead of being limited to the stupid shit the world creator left in the map for you. If avatar pvp ever breaks, I would almost certainly quit vrchat forever. And I know quite a few of my friends who probably would as well.\nSo for god's sakes devs, if you add this for once do something right and give world creators the option to turn it off in their world.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
