      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Agreed, this is something that needs to be improved! 🙏\nIn a full instance, if *all* other players are culled... one would expect performance to be much better than it is now. This is very noticeable for PC, and disastrous for Quest.\nThere's not much we can do as world creators to make large instances run well. Occlusion, frustum and far plane culling aren't very effective for players.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
